    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunter Project: Operation Survive is a top-down action shooter that puts you in the shoes of an agent tasked to go to Earth and make a dent in the infestation called the &quot;Hive&quot;. You and a few other members are alive. Abandoned by the government. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Storyline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cleaner 159 gets assigned to Alpha team after months of trauma from his previous mission. His squad is part of Operation 'Sweeping Rhino'. This operation was meant to make a dent or even clear the infection out on Earth so that the planet could be habitable for humanity to return. 159's team gets wiped when setting off an alarm system. Squadmate after squadmate, devoured by the infected. Leaving him and two others alive inside the facility, left to fend for themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story</strong><br>Play as an Agent trying to make ends meet with his team and a couple of survivors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survival</strong><br>The infected population is unknown hence you are destined to fail. Survive as long as you can. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expeditions</strong><br>Go with a team in a vast and open field, complete tasks while fighting a rogue organization and the infection while encountering survivors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique maps</strong><br>Go from science labs to cities, and play through big open areas to survive or explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Call in 'Support Calls' to help you on your journey</strong><br>Call in special items, equipment, or explosives using unique codes to give you an advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weapons of choice</strong><br>Use different weapons to fight the horde of zombies and hope you don't run out of ammo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892040/extras/b31ea9105413941b340ea8fef51791b7.avif?t=1732723772\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
